"id":"params","text":"params","level":6},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"withform","text":"withForm()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-6","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tformdata-4","text":"TFormData","level":5},{"id":"tonmount-4","text":"TOnMount","level":5},{"id":"tonchange-4","text":"TOnChange","level":5},{"id":"tonchangeasync-4","text":"TOnChangeAsync","level":5},{"id":"tonblur-4","text":"TOnBlur","level":5},{"id":"tonblurasync-4","text":"TOnBlurAsync","level":5},{"id":"tonsubmit-4","text":"TOnSubmit","level":5},{"id":"tonsubmitasync-4","text":"TOnSubmitAsync","level":5},{"id":"tondynamic-4","text":"TOnDynamic","level":5},{"id":"tondynamicasync-4","text":"TOnDynamicAsync","level":5},{"id":"tonserver-4","text":"TOnServer","level":5},{"id":"tsubmitmeta-4","text":"TSubmitMeta","level":5},{"id":"trenderprops-2","text":"TRenderProps","level":5},{"id":"parameters-6","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"namedparameters-3","text":"__namedParameters","level":5},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createFormHook<TComponents, TFormComponents>(__namedParameters): object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/createFormHook.tsx:294](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/createFormHook.tsx#L294)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TComponents\n\n`TComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, `ComponentType`\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n### TFormComponents\n\n`TFormComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, `ComponentType`\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### \\_\\_namedParameters\n\n`CreateFormHookProps`\\<`TComponents`, `TFormComponents`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n### useAppForm()\n\n```ts\nuseAppForm: <TFormData, TOnMount, TOnChange, TOnChangeAsync, TOnBlur, TOnBlurAsync, TOnSubmit, TOnSubmitAsync, TOnDynamic, TOnDynamicAsync, TOnServer, TSubmitMeta>(props) => AppFieldExtendedPreactFormApi<TFormData, TOnMount, TOnChange, TOnChangeAsync, TOnBlur, TOnBlurAsync, TOn